{"id":"5074","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5074_main_anvil-crawler-lightning_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片显示的是美国内布拉斯加州林肯市一道强烈的中级雷暴砧状云的闪电分支。 这些云放电通俗地称为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">“砧状履带”</span>。</p>\n<p>在图像的右侧可以看到无雨<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上升气流</span>底部。在其他地方，云层细节被强降水掩盖。在无雨上升气流底部附近，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水井</span>明显。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国内布拉斯加州林肯","latitude":"纬度: 40° 48' 49'' N","longitude":"经度: 96° 38' 4'' W","date":"01 June 2009 0015 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2.1"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4947_main_lightning-ground-discharge_electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>来自积雨云的闪电<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地面放电</span>（云对地闪电）袭击了香港（中国）山顶的高地。</p>\n<p>一道低压槽为广东沿海地区带来雷阵雨。按照惯例，当闪电发生时，云被归类为积雨云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Irene Ho","location":"中国香港山顶","latitude":"纬度: 22° 16' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 8' 30'' E","date":"31 March 2014 1945 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4950_main_lightning-ground-discharges_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>该图中的主要特征是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的雷电地面放电（云对地闪电）。放电似乎遵循云与地之间的曲折路径，通常称为叉状闪电。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>处主放电的较小分支消散在晴空中。图片左侧从云到大气的放电似乎不会撞击地面并且是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">空气放电</span>。</p>\n<p>当闪电发生时，云被归类为积雨云。如图所示，如果无法确定是秃状云还是鬃状云云种，按照惯例，编码为CL = 9。  </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Duncan Paul Kelly","location":"南非弗莱海德","latitude":"纬度: 27° 45' 41'' S","longitude":"经度: 30° 46' 42'' E","date":"30 December 2011 2257 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4951_main_lightning-from-cumulonimbus-capillatus_clouds-electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>从这个积雨云的下部可以看到闪电击中地面，称为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地面放电</span>。通过<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">纤维状云顶部和云砧</span>（编码CL = 9），云被具体地确定为砧状鬃积雨云。雷雨云（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云内闪电</span>）内发生了其他闪电活动，一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云放电</span>照亮了内部。一个 电闪（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状履带</span>）源于云的上部，云砧下面，并水平移动一段距离，产生几个分支。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Fabrizio Micalizzi","location":"意大利Pace del Mela","latitude":"纬度: 38° 11' 3'' N","longitude":"经度: 15° 18' 41'' E","date":"07 August 2015 0422 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4997_main_thunderstorm_clouds-electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>南中国海北部的热带低气压加剧为名为“银河”的热带风暴。香港（中国）这一天的天气炎热，阳光充足，还有几阵狂风骤雨和雷暴。</p>\n<p>雷暴与积雨云有关，并且通常伴有降水。这张照片显示了晚上从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>中产生的雷暴。雷暴被定义为一次或多次突然放电，表现为闪光<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">（闪电）</span>和刺耳的声音或隆隆声（雷声）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Sung Lok Cheung","location":"中国香港元朗","latitude":"纬度: 22° 28' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 1' 20'' E","date":"26 July 2016 1934 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5024_main_lightning-cloud-discharge_electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>水平范围很大的云到云的闪电放电</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国Chateau Cl, Gothers, St Dennis, Saint Austell","latitude":"纬度: 50° 23' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 4° 51' 36'' W","date":"17 July 2014 2100 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5073_main_lightning-ground-discharge_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>这张照片显示了美国爱荷华州一场相当高层的晚间雷暴期间的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云对地闪电放电</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美利坚合众国爱荷华州大草原","latitude":"纬度: 40° 45' 9'' N","longitude":"经度: 95° 33' 53'' W","date":"31 May 2009 2200 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.0"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5080_main_lightning-cloud-discharge-anvil-zits_clouds-electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc8\"><p>这张照片显示的是在美国德克萨斯州Decatur附近的一场严重雷暴的砧状云中有许多小的闪电放电，非正式地称为“砧状痘”（见<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处）。照片曝光时间为15秒，因此捕捉到了了许多闪电放电的例子。在砧状云中也能明显地看到特征不那么鲜明的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>。雷暴产生了5厘米直径的冰雹。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国德克萨斯州博伊德","latitude":"纬度: 33° 5' 40'' N","longitude":"经度: 97° 38' 47'' W","date":"26 May 2009 2130 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5081_main_lightning-cloud-discharges_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc9\"><p>这张照片显示的是在美国内布拉斯加州的一场傍晚雷暴期间，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处闪电的云放电。雷暴的高度相当高，远处可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>，在其中可以看到一部分风暴的大面积砧状云。在右下方可以看到一个小型的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上升气流</span>顶部，积云状云转变成为了暴风雨。 在风暴之下，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>明显，远处还有其他积云云种。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国内布拉斯加州哈姆雷特","latitude":"纬度: 40° 21' 7'' N","longitude":"经度: 101° 7' 25'' W","date":"23 May 2010 2000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5085_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-cauda_clouds-electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc10\"><p>日落时的低降水超级单体。随着表面温度降低和热量减弱，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上升气流云塔</span>逐渐变窄。最终，云塔变得非常狭窄，上升趋势也停止了。可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水</span>（降雨和冰雹 - 报告有高尔夫球大小的冰雹）从上升气流云塔的右侧（北侧）落下。在上升气流底部的北翼可以看到一个小型的流入尾云，或者是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">尾状云</span>，被雨水冷却的空气被吸入上升气流。上升气流 -下降气流界面附近发生了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">闪电</span>，部分<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">后向切变的云砧</span>被低太阳照亮。在远处可以看到另一个大型的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国德克萨斯州Happy","latitude":"纬度: 34° 38' 56'' N","longitude":"经度: 101° 55' 5'' W","date":"25 May 2010 2000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3 5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3 5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5557_main_anvil-crawler-lightning_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc11\"><p>图为与横跨五大湖下游的强风暴复合体有关的闪电。在晚间，东南方向移动的强冷锋前面，离散对流单体突然变为强飑线。与之过境相伴的是雹、破坏性的风和大雨。本图摄于雷暴复合体北侧，当时它越过加拿大边界进入美国纽约州和宾夕法尼亚州。这种<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云放电</span>俗称“云砧爬虫”，覆盖了一定的水平距离，并生成多条枝杈。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Eric Van Lochem","location":"加拿大，安大略省，哈密尔顿，沃特当","latitude":"纬度: 43° 19' 29'' N","longitude":"经度: 79° 54' 11'' W","date":"09 August 2009 2230 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5568_main_cloud-and-ground-lightning-discharges_electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc12\"><p>闪电放电通常带有一个弯曲的轨迹。图中有一道闪电触及地面，是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云–地放电</span>，而其它数道闪电则在云内或云下横向延伸一定距离。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Hernàn Palmisciano","location":"阿根廷，布宜诺斯艾利斯，阿尔马格罗","latitude":"纬度: 34° 36' 31'' S","longitude":"经度: 58° 25' 18'' W","date":"13 March 2012 0237 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5569_main_lightning-from-cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds-electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc13\"><p>在这张航拍照片中，可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">闪电放电</span>源于巨大<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状鬃积雨云</span>顶部附近。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状</span>附加特征是扩散成砧状的积雨云最上部。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Severin Manuel Baerlocher","location":"印度，旁遮普邦","latitude":"纬度: 30° 17' 49'' N","longitude":"经度: 74° 26' 36'' E","date":"19 December 2010 0213 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1 21","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1 21"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4417_main_lightening-from-cumulonimbus-praecipitatio_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc14\"><p>这张照片中的闪电从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云</span>顶部延伸到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">下方</span>地面。主放电的分支在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处消散于晴空中。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">主通道</span>的下部可见较小的分支。这道闪电外观格外强烈，因为其发光通道位于云层之外。云内也在发生其他闪电活动，如<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>所示。尚不清楚云外闪电是否与云内那次相关联。有时雷声、闪电或冰雹是积雨云存在的唯一迹象，此时无法判断该云种是秃积雨云还是鬃积雨云。按照惯例，这种情况的编码记为C<sub>L</sub> = 9。</p>\n<p>地面附近的静止冷锋位于数百公里以北，高空风力较弱。</p></div>","copyright":"© H.B. Bluestein","location":"Norman, Oklahoma, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 35° 13' 21'' N","longitude":"经度: 97° 26' 22'' W","date":"04 September 1980 2100 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= /, CM= /, CH= /","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}